* (2) Platelet count \<100×10\^9/L;
* (3) Neutrophil count \<1.5×10\^9/L;
* (4) Creatinine \> 1.5 × upper limit of normal (ULN);
* (5) Serum total bilirubin (TBIL) \> 1.5×ULN;
* (6) AST/ALT\> 2.5×ULN;
* (7) Prothrombin and Partial Thromboplastin Times \>1.2×ULN;
